<section style="padding-top: 20px;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="area-content">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>Simpson Climate Control supplies, installs, services and repairs heat pumps and air conditioning across Auckland &mdash; from single-room high-wall units to ducted and commercial systems. The business is built on more than ten years of hands-on experience in the air conditioning and refrigeration trade, and on a simple idea: do the job properly, price it honestly, and back it up afterwards.</p>
      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <p>No sales team, no call centre, no layers of margin. When you get in touch, you deal directly with the people who assess your home, price the job and do the work. That&rsquo;s why our quotes are fixed &mdash; and it&rsquo;s why our Google reviews keep saying the same things: turned up on time, tidy work, straight answers.</p>
      <h2>What we stand on</h2>
      <p><strong>Right-sized, not up-sold.</strong> The correct unit for your room, not the biggest one on the price list. If the cheaper option is the right option, that&rsquo;s the one we&rsquo;ll recommend.</p>
      <p><strong>Proven brands only.</strong> Panasonic, Daikin and Mitsubishi Electric &mdash; hardware that handles New Zealand conditions, with proper manufacturer warranties behind it.</p>
      <p><strong>Fixed pricing.</strong> The price on your quote is the price you pay. Full stop.</p>
      <p><strong>Tidy work, every time.</strong> Drop sheets down, pipework run neatly, packaging taken away, and a walkthrough of the system before we leave.</p>
      <h2>Where we work</h2>
      <p>Based in Remuera, working Auckland-wide &mdash; <a href="/heat-pumps-central-auckland" style="color: var(--blue); font-weight:600;">Central</a>, <a href="/heat-pumps-east-auckland" style="color: var(--blue); font-weight:600;">East</a>, <a href="/heat-pumps-south-auckland" style="color: var(--blue); font-weight:600;">South</a>, <a href="/heat-pumps-west-auckland" style="color: var(--blue); font-weight:600;">West</a> and the <a href="/heat-pumps-north-shore" style="color: var(--blue); font-weight:600;">North Shore</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

